    "rich_text_GiGDJU": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_PkR6tT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>⭐️ \"Love Everything I Ordered!\"</h3><p>Love, love, love everything I ordered! Extremely fast shipping is always appreciated! ❤️ I'm getting my next order ready now!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Great Service & Quality Products\"</h3><p>GREAT SERVICE – QUICK DELIVERY AND QUALITY PRODUCTS AND PRICING. HIGHLY RECOMMEND AND WILL BE PLACING ANOTHER ORDER SOON!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Obsessed with the New Products\"</h3><p>Absolutely love all the new products, shipped quickly and very nice packaging. Steele Sloan Designs is awesome!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Top-Tier Customer Service\"</h3><p>The best customer service, communication, and great quality. She often throws in extras when possible.</p><h3>⭐️ \"Can’t Wait to Share with Customers!\"</h3><p>Incredible service. Superior product. Can’t wait for my customers to check these out! I know these will fly off the shelves!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Exceeded All Expectations\"</h3><p>I don't get excited about customer service often, but Steele Sloan exceeded all my expectations. Fast delivery and beautiful products. I can highly recommend them with no hesitation. I'll be doing a reorder very soon!</p><h3>⭐️ \"First Order – Impressed!\"</h3><p>Our first time ordering and we loved everything we got in! Can't wait to order more!</p><h3>⭐️ \"So Many Compliments!\"</h3><p>Loooovvveeee! Getting so many compliments on the quality of the product! I will for sure be ordering many more! Thank you so much!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Even Prettier in Person\"</h3><p>Really beautiful and even prettier in person.<br/><br/>The pictures don’t do it enough justice. These are stunning, shiny, and so well detailed in person!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Fast & Thoughtful Shipping\"</h3><p>I love these products and the purchasing experience. They came quickly and packed with such care! I have had great luck with these items in my shop and will definitely re-order.</p><h3>⭐️ \"Smooth Process from Start to Finish\"</h3><p>From ordering, shipping, and receiving – working with Steele Sloan has been fast, easy, and amazing!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Always High Quality\"</h3><p>Always quality. One of my favorite companies to order from! You’ll never be disappointed with their quality or service.</p><h3>⭐️ \"Never Disappointed!\"</h3><p>As always, love this jewelry… never disappointed! Excellent quality plus super fast shipping :)</p><h3>⭐️ \"Sure to Sell Fast\"</h3><p>Love everything. Great quality products that are unique and sure to sell fast!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Loved by All Ages\"</h3><p>Beautiful earrings loved by all ages. Customers love them. Fast-selling jewelry. Great gifts.</p><h3>⭐️ \"Perfect Gift Option\"</h3><p>My go-to when customers are looking for a gift. Great style, quality, and price. My favorite boutique item. Exceptional customer service.</p><h3>⭐️ \"Customers Love Them!\"</h3><p>Exceeded our expectations! Customers absolutely love them!! They’re dainty but can be seen!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Well Made!\"</h3><p>Great Product! Well Made!</p><h3>⭐️ \"My Favs!\"</h3><p>My favs! Always happy with my orders. Super fast shipping and outstanding service!</p><h3>⭐️ \"Sold Instantly!\"</h3><p>Quality jewelry! LOVE everything! Sold a necklace 5 minutes after setting it out!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
